    description: "A blog post with metadata and content sections."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Vallum celo acies varietas capillus tripudio.\"\n  slug: \"pauci-clementia-talus\"\n  author: {\n    name: \"Leo Kilback\"\n    avatar: \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/faker-js/assets-person-portrait/female/512/87.jpg\"\n    bio: \"entrepreneur, dreamer\"\n  }\n  date: \"2026-04-18\"\n  tags: [\n    \"strategy\"\n    \"vista\"\n    \"singing\"\n  ]\n\n  published: true\n  reading_time: \"13 min\"\n  summary: \"Campana accusamus vitiosus adhuc contabesco creptio. Capio tres commodi ait adflicto talio patria vulnero. Assumenda depulso amor deprecator coruscus absum derideo abbas audeo decimus.\"\n}"
  }
