  {
    num: "8974"
    title: "Recipe"
    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Lychee And Mango Tart\"\n  servings: 7\n  prep_time: \"40 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"19 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"4 cups mung beans\"\n    \"1 pieces garam masala\"\n    \"4 pieces avocado spread\"\n    \"1 tsp lotus root\"\n    \"4 lbs koshihikari rice\"\n    \"4 pieces smoked trout\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"Tender crocodile skewers, glazed with a sweet and tangy banana sauce, served over a bed of fragrant jasmine rice.\"\n    \"A slow-roasted White-eyed Vireo with a zesty, bitter exterior. Stuffed with lychee and covered in tangelo sauce. Sides with beetroot puree and wild hijiki.\"\n    \"A slow-roasted Falcated Duck with a bitter, bitter exterior. Stuffed with olive and covered in fig sauce. Sides with purple carrot puree and wild purple carrot.\"\n    \"A special orange sage from Peru. To support the strong flavor it is sided with a tablespoon of mint.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 623\n    protein: \"26g\"\n    carbs: \"79g\"\n    fat: \"22g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
